# Environment of the shawk collector (/etc/shawk/collector.env). systemd
# reads it as root: keep it readable by root only (mode 0600).
#   SHAWK_PROMETHEUS_AUTHORIZATION  Authorization header of the push to
#       Prometheus (otlp_http/prometheus in /etc/shawk/collector.yaml):
#       Basic and the base64 of the user and password of the collector in
#       basic_auth_users of the web configuration of Prometheus, e.g.
#       printf 'Basic %s\n' "$(printf '%s' 'shawk-collector:PASSWORD' | base64 -w0)"
#       Without it Prometheus refuses the metrics.
SHAWK_PROMETHEUS_AUTHORIZATION=
